WEBVTT

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.460
The spear!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.260
Regina!

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.660
Begone, Precures!

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.930
I won't give in...

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.490
Until my feelings reach your heart...

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.400
I'll stay standing, Regina!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.640
Aww, they ran away.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.760
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.120
<i>None of us could even touch the spear of light.</i>

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.380
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.150
Hey!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.700
<i>that she's not a Selfish?</i>

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.560
Are you listening?

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:40.590
Yes?

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.430
I'm hungry.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.030
Get me a noodle sub.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.940
Get the lead out!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:47.690
Right away!

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.460
<i>Oh, she's selfish, all right...</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.250
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.720
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.590
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.620
Every day it sparkles

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:10.290
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.190
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.880
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:28.490
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:33.950
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:39.660
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:48.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.200
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.440
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.230
What's more than just cute

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:02.120
is our promise between girls

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:08.160
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:14.060
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.450
I'm glad the Lovely Pad was able to take us back, but...

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.790
We didn't expect to have one of the Sacred Treasures stolen out from under us.

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:32.270
We must defeat Regina immediately and recover the spear of light.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.040
Wait.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.480
I won't fight Regina.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.560
Mana!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:42.340
I'm sure those dark feelings were just planted inside her!

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.310
That again?

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:54.320
Not even my Ace Shot could purify her!

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:57.910
She's King Selfish's daughter through and through.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:00.610
Attempting to reconcile with one who knows no love is—

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.690
Right there!

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.890
Regina said she loved her daddy.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.760
She believes in him with all her heart.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.610
Doesn't that mean that she knows love too?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.710
Feelings can reach anyone who has love.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.920
That's what I believe.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.120
Very well.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.650
I won't press the matter for now.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:32.310
Regardless, it seems our Lovely Pad hides yet another mysterious power.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:36.680
I expect you all to put forth the effort to master it.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.530
Understand?

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.270
Getting Our Feelings Across!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:47.270
Getting Our Feelings Across!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:52.250
It seems Aguri feels responsible for letting the spear get stolen.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.480
I think I know how she feels.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:59.120
I was the one to lose my temper last time.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:04.000
Compared to you two, Mana seems pretty unfazed.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.830
That's because of how strongly she believes in Regina.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:11.570
<i>Mana's trust never wavered once.</i>

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:13.770
<i>But me?</i>

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.310
<i>I held a grudge against her before.</i>

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:19.240
<i>But now...</i>

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:24.350
<i>I think I understand Mana's point of view.</i>

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:31.460
<i>Doesn't that mean that she knows love too?</i>

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:37.020
<i>I want to believe in Regina too.</i>

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:41.390
<i>But what can I do to help myself do so?</i>

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.430
Good morning, everyone!

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.700
Good morning.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.470
Morning, Haruna.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.770
What's this?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.470
Fan letters.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.770
Good for you!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.200
They're <i>yours</i>!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.560
You even reading them?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.510
Of course.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:04:59.410
You write back?

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.070
Well, I... haven't had the time...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.770
What kinda idol doesn't put her fans first?

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.890
I answer every one of mine!

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:08.320
Wow.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:13.700
Well, you don't have to answer them with letters, I guess.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.470
You've got songs, right?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.210
All your fans are waiting for a new one, right?

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.590
Thank you, Haruna!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.710
Wait, Makoto!

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:31.180
Yotsuba Music

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.910
Want some hot chocolate?

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:41.720
Davi.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:45.090
You've been really focused. Working on something new?

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.110
A bit.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.930
It's cold tonight.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.560
Don't stay up too late.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.250
Wait, isn't that...

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.260
the spear of light?

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.540
Bingo!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.240
But how?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.500
Well done, Regina!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:14.990
With one of the three Sacred Treasures within our grasp, nothing will stand in our way!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.960
We shall subjugate the human world in one blow!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.830
Not yet, Daddy.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.960
Human hearts are strong. And nuisances.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.530
We have to weaken their hearts first.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.490
A nice idea...

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.870
But how?

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:33.090
Well, we could use...

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.380
that!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:35.850
Huh?

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:38.180
A CD?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:41.490
Music nourishes the human heart.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.640
So we'll steal their music first.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.920
Kenzaki.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.390
Kenzaki.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.880
Hey, Makopi! Earth to Makopi!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:55.700
Good morning.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.270
Good morning.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.570
Got enough sleep?

00:06:58.570 --> 00:06:59.570
Yes, I'm fine.

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:00.780
Gotta have your priorities.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:01.590
Thank you.

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:02.460
And by the way...

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.050
Yes?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.520
See me after class.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.430
Yes...

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.150
Kenzaki!

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.350
Good morning!

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.580
What's up with Makopi?

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.940
She's been like that all day!

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:18.690
Rachel.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.800
Gotcha!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.360
What are you doing?

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:23.100
Calling an expert.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:23.880
An expert?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:24.820
In what?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:29.530
Makoto seems to be stressed due to her work.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.260
Oh, that's what.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:35.800
Y{*\c&H606454&}o{*\c&H5B6051&}t{*\c&H565C4E&}s{*\c&H51574A&}u{*\c&H4C5347&}ba 
L{*\c&H606454&}i{*\c&H5B6051&}b{*\c&H565C4E&}r{*\c&H51574A&}a{*\c&H4C5347&}ry

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:35.800
Yotsuba 
Library

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.780
No surprise.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.800
She appears to be working on a new song, but...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.360
it seems she's been hit by a writer's block.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.560
Sounds like it was a heavy block.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.480
It's not that kind of block.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:47.920
Makopi.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.990
Girls! Why are you here?

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.890
Don't be like that, Makopi!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.930
If you're having trouble, tell us!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.930
Y{*\c&H606454&}o{*\c&H5B6051&}t{*\c&H565C4E&}s{*\c&H51574A&}u{*\c&H4C5347&}ba 
L{*\c&H606454&}i{*\c&H5B6051&}b{*\c&H565C4E&}r{*\c&H51574A&}a{*\c&H4C5347&}ry

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.930
Yotsuba 
Library

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.930
Yotsuba 
Library

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.180
You're writing a song for Regina?

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:01.930
Yeah.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.850
If I write a song that comes from the heart,

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:09.610
it may be able to get our feelings across to Regina. {start on "Regina"}

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:14.250
So I figured I'd try writing a new song, but...

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:16.400
it just isn't coming together.

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:21.040
Then let's all put our heads together.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:25.700
We all feel the same way about Regina, right?

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:26.620
Yeah.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.320
Girls!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.190
I'd be delighted to assist!

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:35.110
Oh, Aguri.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.150
What are you doing all the way out here?

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:40.060
I-I was simply strolling by...

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.770
Perfect timing, then!

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.060
Girls, it seems Aguri wants to help, too!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.510
W-W-Wait!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.390
Now then, let's all make a great song!

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.390
I-I'm not quite...

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:55.490
Oh yeah, Aguri, what kind of music do you like?

00:08:56.710 --> 00:09:00.020
S-Stuff like <i>Songbird</i>...

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.510
You listen to my music?

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.590
Well, my classmates do...

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.660
I'm flattered!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:06.680
I'll give you an autograph!

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:07.830
Makopi, can I get one too?

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:11.330
Only if you help me write the lyrics.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:14.110
That's so unfair! {alt: Makopi, you Jew!}

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.510
And why did I never think to get an autograph until now, anyway?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.250
From the Heart

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.250
From the Heart

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.750
This is a new song?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.530
Yes.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:16.230
It's a song for a friend who's still far away.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.460
Reserve the stage in front of the station for next Sunday.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.210
Huh?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.540
We're announcing your latest single!

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.260
Now get everything ready.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.740
Right!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.490
It looks good on you, Makoto.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:45.990
Thanks.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:50.690
Will my song touch her heart?

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.670
That's what you wrote it to do, right?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.830
Believe in it.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.880
You picked the absolute <i>worst</i> day to sleep in!

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:01.990
Sorry!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.050
I was so nervous I couldn't sleep!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.370
What are <i>you</i> nervous about?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.020
I've been searching for you girls.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:08.980
Alice!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.690
F{*\fax0.085}r{*\fax0.089}o{*\fax0.094}m {*\fax0.103}t{*\fax0.108}h{*\fax0.112}e {*\fax0.122}H{*\fax0.126}e{*\fax0.131}a{*\fax0.135}rt

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.690
F{*\fax0.085}r{*\fax0.089}o{*\fax0.094}m {*\fax0.103}t{*\fax0.108}h{*\fax0.112}e {*\fax0.122}H{*\fax0.126}e{*\fax0.131}a{*\fax0.135}rt

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.450
Wow, this is huge!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:23.100
If this event goes well, business'll be booming!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:32.780
No, this is about letting the world listen to the song Makoto worked her tail off to write.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.260
All these people came just to listen to a song?

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.020
Music really is dangerous.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.880
That junk's better off gone!

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:55.250
I'll turn you into a splendid Selfish!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.880
CD!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.820
It's a Selfish!

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:18.500
The stage!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.150
Davi!

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.530
Precure Love Link!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:26.500
L-O-V-E!

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:27.300
L-O-V-E!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.070
L-O-V-E!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.070
L-O-V-E!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.200
The blade of courage,

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:50.360
Cure Sword!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.080
I, Cure Sword,

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:59.060
shall sever your ambitions with the blade of love!

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.500
Buy my CD!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:05.470
It's the first print run!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.590
Ooh, not bad.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.690
Regina!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.450
So, where's Mana?

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:24.820
Not here yet.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.790
Oh well.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:31.410
I'll just play with you instead!

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.680
Over here!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.250
That's the princess's spear!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.240
Give it back!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:42.160
It's mine now!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.130
You and your stupid dodging!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.320
No more running away for you.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.080
Stop this, Regina!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.420
I don't want to fight you!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.290
Really?

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:08.120
But aren't I your enemy?

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.010
Selfish!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.130
Self!

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.840
Ace Mirror Flash!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:20.670
Sword!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.790
We're here to save you!

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:23.810
Girls!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.000
Ira!

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.220
Mammo!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.460
It won't be that easy.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.750
Mana, there you are.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.000
Regina, release Sword!

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:36.890
Why?

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:40.860
Because we came to this stage for you!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:46.790
Makopi wanted to write a song to tell you how we feel!

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:50.370
We all helped to write it together!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.210
We were going to debut that song on this stage...

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.100
Like I care.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.410
Get 'em, Selfish!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.950
Seeeeelf!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:14.860
<i>Of course, Regina's right here.</i>

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.020
<i>The song might still reach her...</i>

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:19.370
<i>No,</i>

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.330
<i>I'll </i>make<i> it reach her!</i>

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.600
Davi, can I ask a favor?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.180
Have a handshake coupon!

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:34.980
Heart!

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:38.190
Now, finish them!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.630
Break a leg!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.720
Thank you.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:03.210
On lonely, restless nights

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:07.800
I sing a song to myself

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:15.360
Even in the cold darkness

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:10.750
Makoto?

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:12.320
What?

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.370
What... is this song?

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:20.200
It gives me strength

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:19.700
It makes me feel... strange...

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:26.630
Every single lyric and note

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:32.550
Are like the fragments of a miracle

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.550
Self?

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.840
If I hum them out,

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:38.610
They spread with a tra-la-la

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:48.450
And the melody echoes into the future

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:48.080
My chest... is all tingly...

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:55.100
I sing from the heart

00:16:55.100 --> 00:17:02.170
So my voice can reach the ends of the earth

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:08.690
The flame of my hope lights like it did before,

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:06.250
Why... does my heart keep pounding?

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:09.830
Stop her song already!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:12.810
And each line takes flight

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:11.950
I won't let you!

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:19.190
We sing from the heart

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:14.510
We'll make you...

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.220
Listen to her song!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:17.530
Shut up!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.190
It's an earsore!

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:26.130
And reach the corners of this big, wide world

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:32.600
Even the tears we now shed

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.740
Stop!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.260
Stop it!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:37.070
Will shine brighter than the stars

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:43.080
Let's make a wish and sing tomorrow

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:50.180
While those I love are still with me

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:56.240
Because I want to see you smile

00:17:56.240 --> 00:18:04.250
Brighter than you ever did before

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:15.910
Regina!

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.640
Why is my chest...

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.730
burning so much?!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.900
You're in danger! Run away!

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:26.790
No.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.790
I won't run.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:30.980
Heart...

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.000
Why would I?

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:35.700
I believe in Regina.

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:38.660
Good point.

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:40.300
Me too!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:41.370
I do as well!

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.840
Girls...

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.080
Regina!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:48.850
Regina!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:49.710
Regina!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:51.170
Regina!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.630
The Jewel Lovies!

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:09.930
Ai!

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.440
Cure Heart!

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:17.040
Kyupirappa kyupirappa puppa!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.250
Kyupirappa!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.960
This warm light...

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.410
What's happening?

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.170
Could this be...

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.630
The Lovely Pad's true power?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.290
Girls!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:19.260
Right!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:30.050
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:37.220
Self?!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:49.040
Love love loooooove!

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:54.000
Huh?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.470
I'll remember this, Precures!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:01.300
What's up with her?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.320
Beats me.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.500
Regina...

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:12.990
Sorry, Mana.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:15.860
My song...

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:18.960
couldn't reach Regina.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:22.600
No...

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:26.430
Aguri.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:32.470
Regina's heart wavered upon hearing your song.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:39.340
Or, so it seemed to me.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:47.290
I... suppose Regina may possess a heart that can love.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.620
She does.

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:52.680
I know she has to.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:56.600
Yeah...

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:05.550
{ED}

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.840
Alice, your childhood dream was to become a florist?

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:11.470
It was!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.770
All right, we're gonna make that dream come true!

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.060
Oh no, all the flowers in town are wilting!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:16.410
Whaaa?!

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.840
Is this Regina's doing?

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:19.380
I don't sense a Selfish's presence.

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.850
But if this keeps up, we'll lose every flower in town!

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:24.320
Girls, give me your aid!

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:25.990
We must save the flowers!

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:28.720
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.660
Alice's Dream!

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.660
Alice's Dream!

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:34.030
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
